PoolKit includes the SigLIP 2 text tokenizer (Google, ViT-B-16-SigLIP2), licensed
under the Apache License 2.0. The SigLIP 2 model weights are not included; they
are downloaded at run time from Pool's service.

The downloadable face-attributes model (apparent age range and apparent gender)
was trained on FairFace (Kärkkäinen and Joo, https://github.com/joojs/fairface),
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License. It is downloaded
at run time, not included in the framework.
